url: "https://dhtoolbox.github.io/iTopos"

abstract: >-
  iTópos is an open-source browser-based application for interactive mapping,
  exploration, and temporal visualization of places from the Pleiades gazetteer.
  It supports spreadsheet-based mapping, browsing and filtering of Pleiades places,
  exploration of overlapping historical time periods and temporal attestations,
  and export of mapped place data for further research.

